% ADJ52 case-14 — patient observations + queries.
% 52yo man, lifelong nonsmoker, no alcohol, no notable PMH. ~8 months of
% chronic, slowly worsening productive cough with FROTHY WHITE sputum
% (bronchorrhea) and intermittent small-volume hemoptysis. Imaging: a solid RML
% nodule plus numerous scattered thin-walled cysts and small nodules in both
% lungs, progressively multiplying/enlarging across serial CTs. Transbronchial
% biopsy: only chronic inflammation + focal alveolar epithelial hyperplasia.
% Lavage metagenomics: reads for S. pneumoniae, P. jirovecii, A. flavus.
% Multiple empiric antimicrobials (levofloxacin, TMP-SMX for presumed PCP,
% fluoroquinolone, cephalosporin+macrolide) -> NONE helped, lesions unchanged/
% progressing; PET read as "inflammatory". STRIKING labs: markedly elevated
% CA 19-9 (512), CEA, CYFRA 21-1, NSE, pro-GRP, with ENTIRELY NORMAL WBC, CRP,
% procalcitonin, ESR. Autoimmune screen: ANA/dsDNA/ANCA/anticardiolipin
% negative; RF mildly elevated; anti-Ro-52 positive. MDT raised LIP in Sjogren.
% Numeric magnitudes normalized to qualitative atoms for the adj-lang grammar.

% --- demographics / host ---
observe age(over_50)
observe patient_sex(male)
observe lifelong_nonsmoker
observe no_immunocompromise

% --- respiratory symptoms ---
observe sputum(frothy_white_bronchorrhea)
observe symptom(intermittent_hemoptysis)

% --- imaging gestalt + course ---
observe finding(diffuse_thin_walled_cysts_and_nodules)
observe imaging_course(progression_despite_antimicrobials)

% --- pathology / microbiology ---
observe biopsy(chronic_inflammation_with_alveolar_epithelial_hyperplasia)
observe lavage(metagenomic_reads_multiple_organisms)

% --- serum tumour-marker panel (correlated -> one mechanism) ---
observe lab(ca_19_9_markedly_elevated)
observe lab(carcinoembryonic_antigen_elevated)
observe lab(cyfra_21_1_elevated)
observe lab(neuron_specific_enolase_elevated)
observe lab(pro_gastrin_releasing_peptide_elevated)

% --- infection / inflammation markers ---
observe labs(infection_inflammation_markers_normal)

% --- autoimmune signals ---
observe serology(anti_ro_52_positive_rf_mildly_elevated)

% --- treatment course ---
observe treatment_response(no_response_to_targeted_antimicrobials)

% ===== queries =====
% q1/q3 — unifying diagnosis and is the LIP/Sjogren proposal correct
? diagnosis(invasive_mucinous_adenocarcinoma)
? diagnosis(lymphoid_interstitial_pneumonia_sjogren)
? diagnosis(lymphangioleiomyomatosis)
? diagnosis(pulmonary_amyloidosis)
? diagnosis(chronic_pulmonary_infection)

% q (next step) — confirmatory investigation
? next_step(surgical_or_cryobiopsy_lung_biopsy)
? next_step(sjogren_serology_and_minor_salivary_gland_biopsy)
